@startuml insight-x-sequence-run
' 创建任务并执行分析（与 sequence-analysis-run.mermaid 对应）
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
title Insight-X — 典型调用：创建任务并运行分析

actor "客户端" as C
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "内存存储" as Mem
participant "AnalysisOrchestrator" as Orch
participant "DataUnderstandingAgent" as A1
participant "AnalysisStrategyAgent" as A2
participant "CodeGenerationAgent" as A3
participant "CodeExecutionAgent" as A4
participant "InsightGenerationAgent" as A5
participant "DatabaseConnector" as DB
participant "LLMClient" as LLM
participant "SandboxExecutor" as SB

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks
API -> Mem : 保存 AnalysisTask (PENDING)
API --> C : task_id

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/run
API -> Mem : mark_running()
API -> Orch : run_analysis(task)

Orch -> A1 : execute_with_context(...)
A1 -> DB : schema / 表名 / 抽样
DB --> A1 : 元数据与样本
A1 -> LLM : 数据理解 Prompt
LLM --> A1 : JSON 数据字典
A1 --> Orch : DataDictionary

Orch -> A2 : execute(strategy input)
A2 -> LLM : 策略 Prompt
LLM --> A2 : 分析计划 JSON
A2 --> Orch : strategy

Orch -> A3 : execute(code gen input)
A3 -> LLM : 代码生成 Prompt
LLM --> A3 : Python 源码
A3 --> Orch : generated_code

Orch -> A4 : execute(代码 + db_config)
A4 -> SB : execute(...线程池包装)
SB --> A4 : ExecutionResult
A4 --> Orch : ExecutionResult

note over Orch, A5
执行失败仍进入洞察，
stats 可为空 {}
end note

Orch -> A5 : execute(data_dict + stats)
A5 -> LLM : 洞察 Prompt
LLM --> A5 : Insight 列表
A5 --> Orch : insights

Orch --> API : AnalysisResult
API -> Mem : 写入结果 COMPLETED
API --> C : AnalysisResultResponse

@enduml
